            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for what one can afford, then the Marathi for economical."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: लिलाव",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लिलाव — lilāv — \"an auction\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जुन्या गाड्यांचा लिलाव उद्या आहे. junyā gāḍyāñcā lilāv udyā āhe. The auction of old cars is tomorrow."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लिलाव (lilāv) करणे, to auction; लिलावात घेणे, to buy at auction."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लिलाव (lilāv) is a loan from Portuguese leilão, \"an auction\", from the trade of the west coast."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
