              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने गहाण ठेवलं, tyāne gahāṇ ṭhevlaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The verb agrees with the thing pawned: बांगडी ठेवली, घर ठेवलं."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गहाण ठेवणे (gahāṇ ṭhevṇe) joins गहाण, \"a pledge, a pawn\", inherited from Sanskrit grahaṇa, \"seizing, holding\", where CDIAL lists Marathi gahāṇ (CDIAL 4364), to ठेवणे, \"to put\"."
